<title>USA: Madison, Wis., won by Lehman Brothers.</title>
<headline>Madison, Wis., won by Lehman Brothers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $22 million of Madison, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997-A, with a true interest cost of 5.02 percent.</p>
</text>
